'''''Clouds Leave No Trace''''' is a [[Companion Mission]] in the chapter [[Vita Infinita (Companion Mission Chapter)|Vita Infinita]].

==Steps==
# Read the anonymous letter on the Express
# Show the anonymous letter to Pom-Pom
# Pass the letter to Dan Heng
# Ask Dan Heng about his meeting

