===Pass the letter to Dan Heng{{subst:void|<!--202100102-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Passenger Cabin|update|The business outlined in the letter is muddled. However, it is clear that whoever left it wishes to invite Dan Heng to an "old place" familiar to him and reminisce past friendships.}}
